\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces MoSCoW prioritisation matrix for UniConnecT. The four quadrants (Must Have, Should Have, Could Have, Won't Have) map each feature to its delivery commitment for the current release. Features in the Must Have quadrant were treated as hard scope; their absence would render the platform non-functional for the target university community.}}{16}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
