\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Kano model overview for UniConnecT, organised as three feature categories. \textit  {Basic Needs} (must-be quality): user registration/login, profile creation, and basic feed viewing --- their absence causes immediate dissatisfaction. \textit  {Performance Needs}: search \& filter, message delivery speed, and platform load time --- satisfaction scales linearly with quality. \textit  {Delighters}: AI-powered career match, alumni mentorship matching, smart feed curation, and gamified networking --- unexpected features that create strong positive reactions when discovered.}}{19}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:kano}{{6}{19}{Kano model overview for UniConnecT, organised as three feature categories. \textit {Basic Needs} (must-be quality): user registration/login, profile creation, and basic feed viewing --- their absence causes immediate dissatisfaction. \textit {Performance Needs}: search \& filter, message delivery speed, and platform load time --- satisfaction scales linearly with quality. \textit {Delighters}: AI-powered career match, alumni mentorship matching, smart feed curation, and gamified networking --- unexpected features that create strong positive reactions when discovered}{figure.6}{}}
